{
  "_comment": "emailKey 正規化的共用測試向量。Python（tests/test_emailkey.py）與前端（tests/js/）讀同一份，規則測試（tests/rules/，P3）也用它造登入身分。email 刻意拆成 [@ 前, @ 後] 兩段存：這份檔會被 privacy_scan 掃到，完整的非 example.com 信箱字樣不能連續出現在 repo 裡。規格見 docs/DATA-MODEL.md §0.3。",
  "valid": [
    {"why": "全部轉小寫", "in": ["Parent.A", "Example.COM"], "out": ["parent.a", "example.com"]},
    {"why": "非 gmail 網域：點號照留", "in": ["parent.a", "example.com"], "out": ["parent.a", "example.com"]},
    {"why": "非 gmail 網域：大小寫混合＋點號照留", "in": ["Staff.Member.One", "School.Example.COM"], "out": ["staff.member.one", "school.example.com"]},
    {"why": "gmail：點號全部拿掉", "in": ["parent.a", "gmail.com"], "out": ["parenta", "gmail.com"]},
    {"why": "gmail：大寫＋多個點號", "in": ["P.A.R.E.N.T.A", "GMAIL.COM"], "out": ["parenta", "gmail.com"]},
    {"why": "googlemail：網域統一成 gmail.com", "in": ["parent.a", "googlemail.com"], "out": ["parenta", "gmail.com"]},
    {"why": "googlemail：大小寫混合", "in": ["Parent.A", "GoogleMail.Com"], "out": ["parenta", "gmail.com"]},
    {"why": "gmail：加號後綴照留（只拿點號）", "in": ["parent.a+class", "gmail.com"], "out": ["parenta+class", "gmail.com"]},
    {"why": "前後空白去掉", "in": ["  parent.a", "example.com  "], "out": ["parent.a", "example.com"]},
    {"why": "前後空白＋tab＋換行去掉（gmail）", "in": ["\t Parent.A", "gmail.com \n"], "out": ["parenta", "gmail.com"]},
    {"why": "gmail 的子網域不算 gmail：點號照留", "in": ["parent.a", "mail.gmail.com"], "out": ["parent.a", "mail.gmail.com"]},
    {"why": "長得像 gmail 但不是：點號照留", "in": ["parent.a", "gmail.co"], "out": ["parent.a", "gmail.co"]}
  ],
